{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝呼召以赛亚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["乌西雅王驾崩那年，我看见主坐在高高的宝座上，祂的衣袍下垂，充满圣殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在祂上方侍立着撒拉弗天使，他们各有三对翅膀：一对遮脸，一对遮脚，一对飞翔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们彼此呼喊：",{"text":"“圣哉，圣哉，圣哉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的荣耀充满大地。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他们的呼喊声震动圣殿门槛的基石，圣殿里烟云弥漫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那时我说：“我有祸了！我要灭亡了！因为我嘴唇不洁净，又住在嘴唇不洁净的民中，并且亲眼看见了大君王——万军之耶和华。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有个撒拉弗天使用火钳从祭坛上取了一块燃烧的炭，飞到我面前，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["用炭碰我的嘴，说：“看啊，这炭碰了你的嘴唇，你的过犯已被除掉，你的罪恶已被赦免。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然后，我听见主说：“我可以差遣谁呢？谁肯为我们去呢？”我说：“我在这里，请差遣我！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祂说：“你去告诉这百姓，",{"text":"“‘你们听了又听，却不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看了又看，却不领悟。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要让这些人心灵麻木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵发背，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼睛昏花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得他们眼睛看见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵听见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回心转意，就得到医治。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我说：“主啊，这要到什么时候呢？”祂说：",{"text":"“直到城邑荒凉，无人居住，房屋空置，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地荒废的时候。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必把他们赶到远方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的土地必大量荒废。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使境内只剩下十分之一的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必被消灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，就像砍掉松树和橡树后必留下树桩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"圣洁的苗裔就是残留的树桩。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}